<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/images/favicon.svg">
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>SoundWave | Terms of Service</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet"
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />

    <%- include('../partials/user/theme-config') %>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms"></script>
</head>

<body class="bg-background-soft" style='font-family:"Space Grotesk","Noto Sans",sans-serif;'>
    <%- include('../partials/user/navbar') %>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-10 md:px-6 lg:px-8 xl:px-10">
        <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8 lg:p-10 xl:p-12">
            <nav class="mb-4 flex text-sm text-gray-500" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                <ol class="inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-2">
                    <li class="inline-flex items-center">
                        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-500 hover:text-primary">
                            Home
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li aria-current="page">
                        <div class="flex items-center">
                            <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>
                            <span class="font-medium text-primary">Terms of Service</span>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ol>
            </nav>

            <div class="max-w-6xl space-y-8">
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-primary-light/45 bg-primary-light/10 p-5 md:p-6 lg:p-7">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5">
                        <div class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-primary-light/50 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-primary shadow-sm">
                            <div class="size-4">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                                    <path d="M24 45.8096C19.6865 45.8096 15.4698 44.5305 11.8832 42.134C8.29667 39.7376 5.50128 36.3314 3.85056 32.3462C2.19985 28.361 1.76794 23.9758 2.60947 19.7452C3.451 15.5145 5.52816 11.6284 8.57829 8.5783C11.6284 5.52817 15.5145 3.45101 19.7452 2.60948C23.9758 1.76795 28.361 2.19986 32.3462 3.85057C36.3314 5.50129 39.7376 8.29668 42.134 11.8833C44.5305 15.4698 45.8096 19.6865 45.8096 24L24 24L24 45.8096Z" fill="currentColor" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-base font-bold">SoundWave</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-3">
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary/70">Terms of Service</p>
                            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">Simple expectations for using the SoundWave storefront.</h1>
                            <p class="max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-gray-700 md:text-lg">
                                These terms are meant to keep the platform clear, fair, and easy to use for everyone who shops with us.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-gray-700 md:text-[1.02rem] lg:text-[1.045rem]">
                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Using the store responsibly</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">SoundWave is intended to be used for genuine browsing, shopping, and account-related activity. We expect visitors and customers to use the platform respectfully and in a way that does not interfere with the normal experience of other users.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Account responsibility</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">If you create or use an account on SoundWave, you are responsible for keeping your account information accurate and for protecting access to your account. Activity that takes place through your account should be managed with care.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Product and order expectations</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">We aim to present products, pricing, and order information as clearly as possible. Customers are expected to review their order details carefully before completing a purchase, including product selection, quantity, and shipping-related information where applicable.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Pricing and content updates</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">Store content may change over time. Product availability, pricing, descriptions, and other storefront details may be updated as the catalog evolves or as we improve the shopping experience.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Platform conduct</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">The storefront should not be used in a way that is abusive, misleading, disruptive, or harmful. We want the platform to remain useful, stable, and respectful for customers who are here to browse and shop in good faith.</p>
                    </section>

                    <section class="space-y-2">
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Keeping the experience current</h2>
                        <p class="text-justify">As SoundWave grows, parts of the store experience may be refined or adjusted. When that happens, this page may be updated so that the expectations around using the platform continue to match how the storefront operates.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
